OL,3,GNEWSAMan is 40th to be sentenced over
OL,4,Acity disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed after admitting
OL,7,Fhis part in disorder which took place
OL,8,Fin Leeds two years ago.
OL,10,FThe trouble erupted in Harehills on the
OL,11,Fevening of 18 July 2024 after police
OL,12,Fhelped social workers who were taking
OL,13,Ffour children into emergency foster
OL,14,Fcare. Hundreds of people took to the
OL,15,Fstreets, with a police car flipped over
OL,16,Fand a double-decker bus torched.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
