OL,3,GNEWSAMan is 40th to be sentenced over
OL,4,Acity disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have since pursued those
OL,7,Finvolved in the unrest and 25-year-old
OL,8,FClaudiu Gangal is the 40th person to be
OL,9,Fsentenced as part of what West
OL,10,FYorkshire Police said was a "continuing
OL,11,Finvestigation".
OL,13,FGangal, of Dorset Road in Harehills,
OL,14,Fwas jailed for two years at Leeds Crown
OL,15,FCourt on Thursday after pleading guilty
OL,16,Fto violent disorder.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
